    {
      "bbox": [
        346,
        1302,
        1744,
        1541
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Veterans of the Korean War now in the employ of the City\nare to be extended the same holiday privileges on Armistice Day\nas are granted by law to veterans of World War I and II.",
